text = "[center][font_size=28]If this story touched something in you[/font_size]

Emily's story is fiction, but the feelings in it are real for a lot of people.
If you are thinking about suicide, or you are worried about someone, please reach out.
You are not a burden, and you are not alone.

United States — call or text 988, or text HOME or HOLA to 741741
Canada — call or text 988
UK & Ireland — call Samaritans, 116-123
Australia — call Lifeline at 13-11-14, text 0477-13-11-14, or visit lifeline.org.au
Anywhere else — findahelpline.com

If you are in immediate danger, call your local emergency number.
If there is a gun in your home, storing it locked, unloaded, and apart from ammunition saves lives.


[font_size=60]Thank you for playing![/font_size][/center]"
fit_content = true
horizontal_alignment = 1

